      "statement": "Repeated acquisition, assembly, hashing, preparation, status recording, review and evidence generation serve an identified change, decision or assurance need; repetition creates neither validity nor independence. Reuse requires exact applicability/invalidation. Materially outcome-affecting operational assumptions require UP-019 qualification. Cost claims declare allowance and measured spend or unmeasured status; keep material startup/framework/external/transport/assurance costs apart; declare supported dimensions/workloads before qualification; count context transferred to every delegated actor. Context measurement/fitting follows the referenced context rule. No universal quota, ticket/actor count or accounting carrier follows. Family instance premises are selected outcome, complexity-adding method obligations, a governed cost claim where applicable and bounded-resource activation; these are work conditions, not commitments inferred from finite capacity. The table assigns allowance to the claiming activation and measurement units/boundaries to execution binding. Delivery priority weighs likelihood, impact, reversibility, dependency and delayed feedback; probability waives no hard stop, with the default smallest supported Product path owned by SPEC_METHOD §8. Consumers decide nothing beyond the owning rule.",
